Liner notes is a C BBS for FreeBSD with HyperNotes-style threaded boards,
Telnet access, member mail, chat, file vaults, and optional external transfer
connectors. It includes Japanese and English menus, configurable help files,
offline backup and compaction tools, and a daemon rc.d service.

This local port packages the stage73 review build. It does not migrate an
existing BBS instance and does not enable the service automatically.
